exports[`code mails: the designed HTML part > auto_link: the text part as before; the HTML says each of its sentences, holds the code once, and links nowhere > text 1`] = `
"Your code to link your Google sign-in to the wallet this email opens in “Sodax Demo” with Hana:

550046

It expires in 10 minutes.

Type this code only in the Hana window you opened (hana-id-auth-sandbox-dev.example.workers.dev). Hana never asks for it by phone, chat or on another site.

If you didn’t just sign in with Google, ignore this mail: nothing changes.
"
`;

