"Your code to open one of your wallets in Hana Home, where its private key can be shown to move it to another wallet app:

550046

It expires in 10 minutes.

Type this code only in the Hana window you opened (hana-id-auth-sandbox-dev.example.workers.dev). Hana never asks for it by phone, chat or on another site.

If you didn’t ask Hana Home to open a wallet, ignore this mail: nothing changes. Never give this code to anyone: it opens your wallet.
"
`;

